WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.030
Powdery mildew is a fungus that grows
into the cells on a leaf's surface.

2
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.640
On normal plants, about 80 per cent of
its attempts to enter a cell succeed.

3
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:14.960
And the plant has no antibodies,
no lymphocytes, no phagocytes.

4
00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.770
It can't run away either.

5
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.290
So how does a plant stop an
infection from spreading?

6
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:24.700
In this mission, you'll explore the
barriers a plant always has in place,

7
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.320
from a waxy cuticle to bark.

8
00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.040
Then you'll see what a plant
makes once it detects an attack:

9
00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:33.390
its own chemical weapons.

10
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:38.360
Your mission: find out how a plant,
with no antibodies and nowhere to run,

11
00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.200
stops an infection spreading.
